{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-palette-selector",
  "category": "feedback",
  "title": "<iswc-palette-selector>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "styles": ".row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; }\r\n    .event-log {\r\n      margin-top: 12px;\r\n      padding: 12px;\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);\r\n      border-radius: 8px;\r\n      background: var(--iswc-bg-soft);\r\n      font-family: var(--iswc-mono);\r\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n      min-height: 2em;\r\n      color: var(--iswc-text);\r\n    }\r\n    .event-log .hint { opacity: 0.6; }\r\n\r\n    /* --- Trigger tipo \"logo\" — el consumer pone SU HTML --- */\r\n    .logo-trigger {\r\n      display: inline-flex;\r\n      align-items: baseline;\r\n      gap: 0;\r\n      padding: 0.45em 0.85em;\r\n      background: var(--iswc-logo-bg, #fff);\r\n      color: var(--iswc-logo-fg, #111);\r\n      border-radius: 0.45em;\r\n      font: inherit;\r\n      font-weight: 800;\r\n      letter-spacing: -0.045em;\r\n      text-transform: lowercase;\r\n      transition: filter 120ms ease, transform 120ms ease;\r\n    }\r\n    .logo-trigger:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }\r\n    .logo-trigger:active { transform: translateY(1px); }\r\n    .logo-trigger__lead { color: #000; }\r\n    .logo-trigger__accent { color: var(--iswc-accent, dodgerblue); }\r\n    .logo-trigger__caret {\r\n      margin-left: 0.5em;\r\n      font-size: 0.95em;\r\n      opacity: 0.7;\r\n      color: var(--iswc-text, #111);\r\n    }",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-palette-selector",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Selector visual de paletas de marca. Por defecto expone las 3 paletas de <code class=\"code\">styles/palettes.css</code>; el consumidor puede pasar su propio array JSON para usar SU marca y SU CSS, y opcionalmente inyectar un trigger personalizado en el slot <code class=\"code\">trigger</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"row\">\r\n            <iswc-palette-selector id=\"defaultPalette\" scope=\"root\"></iswc-palette-selector>\r\n            <iswc-theme-toggle id=\"defaultTheme\" scope=\"root\"></iswc-theme-toggle>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div data-palette=\"insoft\" data-theme=\"light\" class=\"theme-light\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;padding:1rem;border-radius:0.6em;background:var(--iswc-bg);color:var(--iswc-text)\">\r\n            <iswc-palette-selector scope=\"closest\"></iswc-palette-selector>\r\n            <iswc-theme-toggle scope=\"closest\"></iswc-theme-toggle>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-palette-selector></iswc-palette-selector>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "custom-trigger",
      "title": "Botón personalizado",
      "lede": "El <code class=\"code\">slot=\"trigger\"</code> del componente permite al consumidor inyectar SU HTML para el botón. Esto es ideal cuando el botón lleva el logo de marca (dos mitades con colores) o cualquier look que el trigger interno no represente bien.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"row\">\r\n            <iswc-palette-selector id=\"logoPalette\">\r\n              <button type=\"button\" slot=\"trigger\" class=\"logo-trigger\" aria-label=\"Elegir paleta de marca\">\r\n                <span class=\"logo-trigger__lead\" data-role=\"lead\">in</span><span class=\"logo-trigger__accent\" data-role=\"accent\">soft</span>\r\n                <iswc-icon class=\"logo-trigger__caret\" icon=\"mdi:chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </iswc-palette-selector>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-palette-selector>\n  <button slot=\"trigger\" class=\"logo-trigger\">\n    <span class=\"logo-trigger__lead\">in</span>\n    <span class=\"logo-trigger__accent\">soft</span>\n  </button>\n</iswc-palette-selector>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p class=\"lede\">El sitio actualiza el contenido del trigger cuando cambia la paleta (lead/accent pueden cambiar con la marca). Mira el código demo para ver cómo se sincroniza.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "custom",
      "title": "Paletas personalizadas",
      "lede": "Cada paleta trae bg y content. content es json2xml: un objeto { iswc-text: { color, content } } se vuelve el elemento iswc-text. Al cambiar value se repinta el botón.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"row\" data-palette=\"acme\">\n            <iswc-palette-selector id=\"customPalette\" scope=\"closest\" value=\"acme\" palettes='[{\"value\":\"acme\",\"label\":\"Acme Corp\",\"bg\":\"#fff\",\"fg\":\"#111\",\"content\":[{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#111\",\"content\":[\"ac\"]}},{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#e03131\",\"content\":[\"me\"]}}]},{\"value\":\"ocean\",\"label\":\"Ocean\",\"bg\":\"#fff\",\"fg\":\"#111\",\"content\":[{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#111\",\"content\":[\"o\"]}},{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#0ea5e9\",\"content\":[\"cean\"]}}]},{\"value\":\"forest\",\"label\":\"Forest\",\"bg\":\"#fff\",\"fg\":\"#111\",\"content\":[{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#111\",\"content\":[\"f\"]}},{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#22c55e\",\"content\":[\"orest\"]}}]},{\"value\":\"dusk\",\"label\":\"Dusk\",\"bg\":\"#fff\",\"fg\":\"#111\",\"content\":[{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#111\",\"content\":[\"d\"]}},{\"iswc-text\":{\"color\":\"#a855f7\",\"content\":[\"usk\"]}}]}]'></iswc-palette-selector>\n          </div>",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:value",
              "label": "value",
              "options": [
                "acme",
                "ocean",
                "forest",
                "dusk"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-palette-selector value=\"acme\" palettes='[\n  {\n    \"value\": \"acme\",\n    \"label\": \"Acme Corp\",\n    \"bg\": \"#fff\",\n    \"fg\": \"#111\",\n    \"content\": [\n      { \"iswc-text\": { \"color\": \"#111\", \"content\": [\"ac\"] } },\n      { \"iswc-text\": { \"color\": \"#e03131\", \"content\": [\"me\"] } }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"value\": \"ocean\",\n    \"label\": \"Ocean\",\n    \"bg\": \"#fff\",\n    \"fg\": \"#111\",\n    \"content\": [\n      { \"iswc-text\": { \"color\": \"#111\", \"content\": [\"o\"] } },\n      { \"iswc-text\": { \"color\": \"#0ea5e9\", \"content\": [\"cean\"] } }\n    ]\n  }\n]'>\n</iswc-palette-selector>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "events",
      "title": "Eventos",
      "lede": "El componente emite <code class=\"code\">iswc-palette-change</code> cuando el usuario selecciona una paleta. <code class=\"code\">detail.value</code> trae el identificador, <code class=\"code\">detail.palette</code> trae el objeto entero.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-palette-selector id=\"evPalette\"></iswc-palette-selector>\r\n          <div class=\"event-log\" id=\"evLog\"><div class=\"hint\">Selecciona una paleta para ver el evento.</div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
